-- P80：创建 OWNER + CHILD 后删除 CHILD。elementDeleted 经祖先 created 判定进入 created 分支，
-- 不应记录生产删除；OWNER 仍保留。
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P AMS-R3-P80-APPLY-ALIVE
{{WORLD_ANCHOR}}
{{TARGET_NAME}}-Z
NEW EQUIPMENT {{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
POS E 41000 N 5000 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
NEW BOX XLEN 1000 YLEN 600 ZLEN 400
NAME {{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD
POS E 500 N 0 U 0
Q REF
Q NAME
Q OWNE
{{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
Q MEMB
{{TARGET_NAME}}-CHILD
Q REF
Q NAME
Q OWNE
DELETE BOX
{{TARGET_NAME}}-OWNER
Q MEMB
SAVEWORK 'AMS round3 P80 created ancestor delete'
$P AMS-R3-P80-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
